      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a lot of sensory and mental overload, which is incredibly exhausting. Sometimes, the most profound silence isn't found by blocking out the world, but by finding a quiet space within yourself. Try deep, slow breathing exercises for a few minutes, focusing only on the in and out of your breath to create a small pocket of stillness. Even five minutes of focused, quiet time can help lower the overall volume in your mind.",
