    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "breathing doesn't really work for me. it’s like... even when i close my eyes, the static is still there. i can feel it under my skin. it's not just a \"mental\" thing, it feels permanent. like no matter how much i rest, the volume just keeps going up. i don't want a \"pocket\" of stillness for five minutes, i just want it to actually stop. i need it to be gone for good.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
