      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If the noise feels like a constant, overwhelming presence under your skin, it might be time to explore a different kind of relief. Since breathing isn't enough, perhaps a change in your physical environment or a more intense grounding technique could help shift that feeling. Consider a very cold shower or holding an ice cube; the intense physical sensation can sometimes interrupt the overwhelming mental static. If these sensations feel permanent and unbearable, please know that professional support is available.",
      "source": "target",
