      "content": "ice cubes or showers just feel like more sensations. more things to process, more things to feel. it's just adding to the noise. i don't want to \"interrupt\" it or manage it... i just want it to end. everything is so loud and i'm just so exhausted by existing in it. is there any way to actually get that absolute, perfect silence? like, the kind where nothing can ever touch you again?",
